  "operative_text": "(a_in_person_id) not stated.\n(b_no_id_remedy) not stated.\n(c_mail_ballot_id) not stated.\n(d_proof_of_citizenship) not stated.\n(e_other_rule)\n(section) s. 66.0438 (2) (a) (local-government photo ID cards)\n(quote) (a) Except as provided in par. (b), no town or county may issue, or expend any funds for the issuance of, a photo identification card for any resident of the town or county.\n\n(note) Off this topic: the bill sets no ID or citizenship-proof rule.",
